<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Expedition bookings · bitcoin++</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/antarctica-admin.css?v=cancellations-2"></head><body class="expedition-admin"><main class="expedition-admin__shell">
<a class="expedition-admin__back" href="/admin/antarctica">← Antarctica administration</a>
<header class="expedition-admin__hero"><div><p class="expedition-admin__eyebrow">Cold Storage Edition</p><h1>{{if .Booking}}Manage booking{{else}}Expedition bookings{{end}}</h1><p>Review passage payments and manage guest-requested cancellations.</p></div>{{if .Booking}}<a class="ea-button ea-button--secondary" href="/admin/antarctica/bookings">All bookings</a>{{end}}</header>
{{with .Booking}}
<section class="ea-card"><div class="ea-card__heading"><h2>{{.Quantity}} passenger{{if ne .Quantity 1}}s{{end}}</h2><span class="ea-status">{{.State}}</span></div><p class="ea-help" style="overflow-wrap:anywhere">Booking {{.ID}}</p>
{{if .CancelledAt}}<div class="ea-notice"><strong>Booking cancelled. Berths released.</strong><p>Cancelled {{.CancelledAt.Format "January 2, 2006 at 15:04 MST"}}.</p><p>{{.Reason}}</p><p>Cancellation does not send money. The refund balance below updates when shared billing records a completed refund.</p></div>{{else}}<p>This action cancels the <strong>entire booking ({{.Quantity}} passenger{{if ne .Quantity 1}}s{{end}})</strong>, releases its berths and stops future installment payments and queued reminders. It is separate from abandonment for non-payment.</p>{{end}}
<dl class="ea-inventory"><div><dt>Passage payments received</dt><dd>{{$.Paid}}</dd></div><div><dt>Non-refundable deposit</dt><dd>{{$.Deposit}}</dd></div><div><dt>Already refunded</dt><dd>{{$.Refunded}}</dd></div><div><dt>Refund still due · USD</dt><dd>{{$.RefundDue}}</dd></div></dl>
<p>{{if .Eligible}}Cancellation before October 1, 2027 (America/Chicago): passage payments received, less the initial 20% deposit and any refunds already issued.{{else}}No refund for cancellation on or after October 1, 2027 (America/Chicago).{{end}}</p>
{{if eq .Provider "opennode"}}<p>Bitcoin refund entitlement uses the USD value recorded when each payment was received. Send the USD-equivalent refund in Bitcoin at the exchange rate when it is sent, then record it through the shared refund workflow.</p>{{else}}<p>Issue any refund due through Stripe. Completed refunds synchronize into the payment history. <a href="https://dashboard.stripe.com/payments" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open Stripe payments ↗</a></p>{{end}}
{{if $.CanCancel}}<form method="post" class="ea-cancel-form"><input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="{{$.CSRF}}"><input type="hidden" name="snapshot" value="{{.Token}}"><label class="ea-field">Cancellation reason<textarea name="reason" required maxlength="1000" rows="3" placeholder="For example: guest requested cancellation, or completed checkout test"></textarea></label><label class="ea-review"><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required><span>I confirm cancellation of all {{.Quantity}} passenger{{if ne .Quantity 1}}s{{end}}, release of their berths, and the refund balance above. I understand this does not send a refund.</span></label><div class="ea-actions"><button class="ea-button" type="submit">Cancel booking &amp; release berths</button></div></form>{{else}}{{if ne .State "cancelled"}}<div class="ea-readiness"><h3>Cancellation needs review</h3><p>This booking is not confirmed, has unresolved payments, or has custom cancellation terms. Resolve those items before cancelling.</p></div>{{end}}{{end}}
<details class="ea-editor"><summary>Accepted terms · {{.PolicyVersion}}</summary><div style="white-space:pre-wrap;padding:20px">{{.Terms}}</div></details>
</section>
<section class="ea-card" style="margin-top:24px"><div class="ea-card__heading"><h2>Payments &amp; refunds</h2><a href="/expeditions/admin/bookings/{{.ID}}">Lifecycle audit →</a></div>{{range .Orders}}<article style="padding:16px 0;border-top:1px solid #dce3e6;overflow-wrap:anywhere"><a href="/admin/merch/orders/{{.PublicID}}">Order {{.PublicID}} →</a><p class="ea-help">{{.Provider}} · {{.Reference}}</p></article>{{else}}<p>No settled payments found.</p>{{end}}</section>
{{else}}
<section class="ea-card"><form method="get" class="ea-actions" style="margin:0;padding:0;border:0"><label class="ea-field">Find by purchaser email<input type="email" name="email" value="{{.Query}}" placeholder="nifty@btcpp.dev"></label><button class="ea-button">Find bookings</button></form><p class="ea-help">Up to 100 most recent confirmed or closed bookings.</p>{{range .Bookings}}<article style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;border-top:1px solid #dce3e6;padding:20px 0"><div style="min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere"><strong>{{.Email}}</strong><p class="ea-help">{{.Quantity}} passenger{{if ne .Quantity 1}}s{{end}} · {{.State}}</p></div><a class="ea-button ea-button--secondary" href="/admin/antarctica/bookings/{{.ID}}">Manage booking →</a></article>{{else}}<p>No bookings found.</p>{{end}}</section>
{{end}}</main></body></html>
